<cartridge xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" version="7.2.0" name="ExcludeTest" type="Cartridge" id="b94e3aaa-29bb-4c95-a467-1ff17630666e">
	<description><![CDATA[This cartridge illustrates mapping from external to internal message.

To run,

1) Select the Mapping 'InvoiceAscDelToInvoiceNO' in Simulator.
2) Open a sample file from the 'sample' directory (under the cartridge directory), in the 'Input' text area.
3) Click 'Submit'.

The consolidated output will be displayed in the Output pane.
]]></description>
